Vinci (Erich Oswald) - a language for describing graphics: the descriptions are turned into Scheme
and run, and draw on the screen, into EPS files, or as shapes in Leonardo figures

  VinciDocs.Open Smiley.Vinci        a Vinci program drawn in a document
  VinciDocs.ToEPS Smiley.Vinci x.eps (with the document marked) the drawing as EPS
  Desktops.OpenDoc Vinci.Text        the description of the language
  Examples: Clip.Vinci, Labels.Vinci, Smiley.Vinci, Stars.Vinci, Test.Vinci; shapes for Leonardo:
  CoordSys.Shape, Distance.Shape, NGon.Shape, Rect2.Shape, YinYang.Shape
